  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ead4598a3cf9c9d",
      "translationZh": "LFM2.5-24B-A2B 是一个拥有 24B 参数、但仅激活 2B 参数的推理模型，专为在设备端运行快速、私密的智能体而构建。它先思考再回答，能够调用工具，并在常用的智能体运行框架中完成多步骤任务。由于每个 token 仅激活 2B 参数，每个推理 token 的成本都很低，因此你可以在自己的硬件上持续运行智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "12bda08b0e864af3",
      "translationZh": "同类领先的智能体：在智能体任务和工具使用任务上，可与总参数量和激活参数量均多约 50% 的 Qwen3.6-35B-A3B 相媲美；在 LiveClaw 上得分为 48.09，而后者为 38.19。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "00b239347516c953",
      "translationZh": "以 MoE 的速度进行推理：始终先思考再回答。每个 token 仅激活 2B 参数，因此每个推理 token 的成本都很低。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5090009c0683ed81",
      "translationZh": "高效推理：在 Apple M5 Max 上达到 184 tok/s，在单张 NVIDIA B300 GPU 上的输出速度最高可达 21K tok/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "96ee5897a0efd603",
      "translationZh": "我们如何构建一个仅激活 2B 参数的推理智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb09b1e7610ff51d",
      "translationZh": "LFM2.5-24B-A2B 基于 LFM2-24B-A2B 构建，并保留了其架构：40 层，每个 MoE 模块包含 64 个专家并采用 top-4 路由，以及相同的门控短卷积与 GQA 混合架构。上下文窗口从 32K 扩大到 131K tokens，通过原位扩展分词器，词表规模从 65K 翻倍至 128K tokens，以改善非拉丁文字的分词。与前代不同，它是一个仅采用推理模式的模型，会在最终回答之前生成显式的思维链。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "048495e905d06c70",
      "translationZh": "预训练规模从约 17T 扩大到约 33T tokens。随后，中期训练在 32K 上下文长度下增加了 2T tokens，侧重推理、数学、代码、指令遵循和多语言文本；并在 131K 上下文长度下增加了 300B tokens，侧重长上下文数据。工具调用和多轮交互轨迹贯穿这两个阶段。后训练通过五个阶段将基础模型转变为智能体：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "96f5de779b9b1cf9",
      "translationZh": "监督微调（SFT）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0f6e5b78965f8233",
      "translationZh": "教师模型专门化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8812b9a08f784834",
      "translationZh": "多领域同策略蒸馏（MOPD），非智能体式：在非智能体任务上对专门化的教师模型进行蒸馏。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c39a1b47957457ed",
      "translationZh": "MOPD，智能体式：第二阶段蒸馏，专注于智能体任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2730e8f1f8647c85",
      "translationZh": "智能体强化学习（Agentic RL）：在 OpenClaw、Hermes Agent、Pi 和 OpenCode 等智能体运行框架中训练模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c7d20824eaa3a66e",
      "translationZh": "基准测试结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fb880bdea1d62a5",
      "translationZh": "我们在 16 项基准测试中评估了 LFM2.5-24B-A2B，并将其与 Qwen3.6-35B-A3B、Gemma-4-26B-A4B-it 和 Nemotron-3.5-Lightning 进行了比较，测试涵盖工具使用与智能体工作流、知识、指令遵循、数学和编程。它是这组模型中最小的，但仍能与总参数量和激活参数量均多出约 50% 的 MoE 模型相媲美。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1fa330e271ba9b77",
      "translationZh": "基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fac9290cf9e714a",
      "translationZh": "τ³-Bench 银行业",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f1c903b131c889c",
      "translationZh": "*所有模型均使用 vLLM 进行评测，并采用各基准推荐的生成参数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e40643291ba84ff2",
      "translationZh": "对于你的应用而言，其优势在于工具使用和指令遵循。LFM2.5-24B-A2B 在八项工具使用和智能体基准中的五项（AutomationBench、BFCLv4、ToolSandbox、LiveClaw 和 τ³-Bench Banking）上领先于或追平竞品，并且在 AutomationBench 上的得分超过排名第二的模型的三倍。它还在全部三项指令遵循基准上领先。更大的模型在 GPQA Diamond、HLE 和 AA-Omniscience 等知识密集型基准，以及 SWE-Bench Verified (OpenCode) 和 SciCode 等编程基准上仍保持优势，因此，对于知识密集型工作负载，应将 LFM2.5-24B-A2B 与检索或网页搜索搭配使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d332c5291fa3e855",
      "translationZh": "这些结果使 LFM2.5-24B-A2B 成为需要推理、调用工具并在你的设备上可靠运行的智能体的坚实基础。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c21529441559aa3b",
      "translationZh": "CPU 和 GPU 上的推理速度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37aaf2273d837a9a",
      "translationZh": "LFM2.5-24B-A2B 在发布首日便获得推理生态中各类工具的支持，包括 llama.cpp、MLX、vLLM、SGLang 和 ONNX。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ace551c03680ab51",
      "translationZh": "边缘推理。LFM2.5-24B-A2B 是参与比较的 MoEs 中速度最快的，在 M5 Max 上的解码速度为 184 tokens/s，在 Ryzen AI Max+ 395 上为 114 tokens/s。其速度最高可达排名第二的模型的 1.7 倍，同时内存占用最低。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a71e2affd5e000ed",
      "translationZh": "GPU 推理。LFM2.5-24B-A2B 是同等规模中速度最快的模型，在单张 B300 上以高并发运行时，每秒输出超过 21K 个 token。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "81220f83f8ea0ea9",
      "translationZh": "如何使用 LFM2.5-24B-A2B",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26127487a52d262e",
      "translationZh": "当你需要能够推理、调用工具并在你的设备上可靠运行的智能体时，就选用 LFM2.5-24B-A2B。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38574dbe1cc107b3",
      "translationZh": "安装最新版本的 transformers（兼容 transformers>=5.0.0）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "677f5202332b7a88",
      "translationZh": "然后加载并运行模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9404434e035da1dc",
      "translationZh": "在你的智能体运行框架中使用它",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b075de137efc854b",
      "translationZh": "通过任意兼容 OpenAI 的后端在本地部署 LFM2.5-24B-A2B 服务，然后将你的智能体运行框架指向该服务。例如，使用 Hermes Agent：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c13195d7ab55a43b",
      "translationZh": "端口取决于你使用的推理服务后端：llama.cpp 和 MLX 使用 8080，vLLM 使用 8000，SGLang 使用 30000，LM Studio 使用 1234。请参阅模型卡，了解 OpenClaw 和 Pi 的配置，并参阅我们的指南，了解完整的设置流程。视频示例请查看我们的发布博客。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "af9b71657a71e614",
      "translationZh": "开始使用 LFM2.5-24B-A2B",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58ede81dbbba7102",
      "translationZh": "LFM2.5-24B-A2B 和 LFM2.5-24B-A2B-Base 均开放权重，现已在 Hugging Face 上提供：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f29b8b771dafd56b",
      "translationZh": "下载：在 Hugging Face 上下载 LFM2.5-24B-A2B-Base 和 LFM2.5-24B-A2B。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bb47fedaba567364",
      "translationZh": "在你的运行框架中使用：按照我们的指南，运行 OpenClaw、Hermes Agent 和 Pi 等本地智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8fae9881eefb94d8",
      "translationZh": "微调：通过我们的微调教程，让 LFM2.5-24B-A2B 适配你的任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7478e6c29f8d5a93",
      "translationZh": "我们迫不及待地想看看你会打造出什么。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2955789aa4f8eb36",
      "translationZh": "引用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34de45e390d74eb7",
      "translationZh": "如果您使用这项工作，请引用发布博客：",
